android test bin is located at android folder, SOS test bin is located at sos folder.

to add vdmabuf device to guest, should add "`add_virtual_device  13 vhost-vdmabuf`" in launch script.

Test case 1: android guest sharing buffer to sos
1: run consumer service in sos
./vdmabuf_unit_test_consumer --backend --vm $VM_Name

2: run producer in android
./vdmabuf_unit_test_producer

3: check result
if print "TEST PASS", mean it passes.


Test case 2: sos sharing buffer to android guest
1: run consumer service in android
./vdmabuf_unit_test_consumer

2: run producer in sos
if producer in SOS:
./vdmabuf_unit_test_producer --backend --vm $VM_Name

3: check result
if print "TEST PASS", mean it passes.
